# Neither frame carries a NEXT_HOP attribute beside MP_REACH_NLRI: the next hop
# rides in MP_REACH_NLRI alone. RFC 4760 Section 3: "An UPDATE message that
# carries no NLRI, other than the one encoded in the MP_REACH_NLRI attribute,
# SHOULD NOT carry the NEXT_HOP attribute." These are the bytes the ExaBGP 6.0
# pin (685f772e4) sends under --dut exabgp, and Ze follows them by owner
# decision of 2026-10-20 (family.Family.LegacyNextHop).
